{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_16208031","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16208031","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1620803101:0":{"text":"し、処罰なんて怖くないぞ！どっからでもかかてこい――","source_cn":"来吧！可怕的惩罚，我已经准备好——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEAD3920D57F5F84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620803102:0":{"text":"……あれ、守衛が来ない……？夜に図書館へ入るのは校則違反のはずだよな……","source_cn":"……奇怪，没有守卫？晚上踏入图书馆应该已经违反规定了才对……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB30D96ADEB7CBF80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620803103:0":{"text":"まあいっか、これもデューラ様のご加護に違いない！えっと、『錬金魔法総まとめ問題集』はこの辺にあるはず……","source_cn":"艾雅保佑，这是绝佳的机会！《炼金魔法总结题册》应该就在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D00A00AE259B442","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:7:1620804001:":{"text":"あった！","source_cn":"终于找到了！<key:dialog77>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44007B1F1225794A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:7:1620804002:":{"text":"よし、急いで外に――","source_cn":"趁现在，开溜","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCA3DA7DB901620A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:7:1620804003:":{"text":"ふはははは……","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈哈……<key:dialog5>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8D2775C939E128D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:7:1620804004:":{"text":"な、なんだ！？","source_cn":"什、什么声音？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7F8F85F02F3EC18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1620803104:0":{"text":"ふはははは……","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈哈……<key:dialog6>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x688E80E7DF83712D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1620803105:0":{"text":"苦しめ、泣き叫べ！貴様らの魂は未来永劫、炎獄にてもがき続けるのだ！","source_cn":"痛苦吧，哀嚎吧！我要让你们的心灵永远在火焰中挣扎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B6DC2BB3F4A34DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1620803106:0":{"text":"世界を燃やし尽くし……生きとし生けるものに絶望を味わわせてやる！はーはははっ！","source_cn":"让这个世界焚烧……让所有人体验绝望！哈哈哈哈哈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C34E0FE7E9BC3C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1620803107:0":{"text":"お、おおお……","source_cn":"这、这是……<key:dialog5>","sta